  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Trap. When Flame Trap is triggered, every second (for 3 seconds total), all nearby foes are struck for 5...17...20 fire damage and set on fire for 1...3...3 second[s]. Flame Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.",
      "zhTW": "當火焰陷阱被觸動時，使陷阱附近的所有敵人每秒受到 5～20 火焰傷害(持續3秒)，並且使其遭受「著火」病症 1～3 秒。火焰陷阱在 90 秒後消失。此技能發動時容易被中斷。"
    },
    "pvp": null
  },
